## Question bloquante (protocole docs/02_QA_PROTOCOL.md)
Ecris `docs/qa/inbox/E07-06-Q1.md` (format: TYPE, TASK, BLOCKED_ON, QUESTION, WHAT_I_KNOW, OPTIONS A/B, DEFAULT_I_WOULD_PICK, CODE_STATE),
puis `kanban_block(reason="QUESTION E07-06-Q1: <question>. See docs/qa/inbox/E07-06-Q1.md")` et arrete-toi.
